{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "xosuint2nkt253ls", "title": "82.基于Coze开发电商售后客服", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"a4c71443\" id=\"a4c71443\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31bcd31f\" id=\"u31bcd31f\">背景介绍 </span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ue16a0eb6\" id=\"ue16a0eb6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd7297cc\" id=\"ucd7297cc\">常见用户视角的智能客服流程为：自助解决-&gt;智能客服-&gt;人工客服。 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2db6f591\" id=\"u2db6f591\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub9d10c95\" id=\"ub9d10c95\">在电商场景中，人工客服往往会耗费极高的人力成本。而且，当问题集中涌现时，客户进线后等待时间过长，这会进一步降低用户对商品的印象分。在此场景下，“大模型回复+人工监管”的模式，能够在很大程度上优化客户进线后的等待体验，同时也能优化人工客服的人力支出。 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufdc56a22\" id=\"ufdc56a22\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba927d40\" id=\"uba927d40\">本模板为抖音电商团队的智能客服同款模板，目前，抖音电商客服正在推进大模型能力的全面应用，预期能够解决90%的客户问题，剩余10%为人工监管带来的支持。 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"udf93458d\" id=\"udf93458d\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1744424836998-aee2aeae-7116-43bb-878e-35e6aa582b26.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u57fe7987-3f25-4a3b-be82-6d233b3081c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9f24b71f-992c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A367.55555555555554%2C%22height%22%3A379%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A187826%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A827%2C%22originHeight%22%3A853%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B0%8F%E4%B8%BB%E6%82%A8%E5%A5%BD%E5%91%80%2C%E8%8B%A5%E6%82%A8%E8%A6%81%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E5%94%AE%E5%90%8E%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%2C%E5%8F%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A534%2C%22y%22%3A427%2C%22width%22%3A220%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9C%A8APP%E6%88%96%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%5C%22%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A2%